#question(title: [Temperature], centered: true)[
  On June 09, 2016, the outside temperature
  in Toronto at 6 AM was $10^circle.small$.
  At 4 PM, the temperature was
  $20^circle.small$.

  + Must there have been a time between 6 AM
    and 4 PM when the temperature was
    $15^circle.small$? Explain how you know.
    Which assumption about temperature allows
    you to reach your conclusion?
  + Must there have been a time between 6 AM
    and 4 PM when the temperature was
    $22^circle.small$? Explain how you know.
  + Could there have been a time between 6 AM
    and 4 PM when the temperature was
    $22^circle.small$? Explain how you know.
]
